    "reading": "5 years",
    "interpretation": "Average time from request to commercial operation, creating the structural need for BTM power."
   }
  ],
  "risks": [
   "Regulatory risk: Diverging state-level policies on large-load grid impact and cost-sharing.",
   "Fuel price risk: Gas-fired technologies remain exposed to natural gas price floors.",
   "Execution risk: Long-duration private power projects are capital-intensive and site-specific, making them difficult to redeploy if the thesis changes.",
